# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ═══ Parcis Environment Variables - EXAMPLE TEMPLATE ═════════════════════════
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in your real private keys and project credentials in .env
# 3. NEVER commit .env to GitHub (it is listed in .gitignore)
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Active Network Selector ──
# Set to "mainnet" or "testnet" to dynamically switch contracts, RPCs & explorers.
VITE_NETWORK=mainnet
NETWORK=mainnet

